{#- The question both answers to a move put to the owner of an undecided draft: the dialog and the page without script. While another shared round stays open, shareBlockedReason says why the draft may not be shared now. -#}
{% if shareBlockedReason is null %}
<p>Your draft round has {{ draft.screenshotCount }} {{ 1 == draft.screenshotCount ? 'screenshot' : 'screenshots' }}. Share it with the team as round {{ draft.roundNumber }}, or keep it private. Private notes stay readable for you and Claude Code.</p>
{% else %}
<p>{{ shareBlockedReason }}</p>
<p>Your draft round has {{ draft.screenshotCount }} {{ 1 == draft.screenshotCount ? 'screenshot' : 'screenshots' }}. Keep it private and move; you can share it later. Private notes stay readable for you and Claude Code.</p>
{% endif %}
